		{
			dependencies: ["327C37975E5EFBA1"]
			description: ["The &6Mirror Shell&r wraps the black hole in mirrors and sends its light back in. &oFiction:&r a shell like this cannot be built; the hole and its light are real. It is the largest structure in the pack. Thirty-three cubes of clear space around the hole, the gradient map and the cryocooler, and a wireless network that holds the load. The segments, the four horizon machines and the last recipe. Segments leave the line on a belt; plan the bus before you place the controller."]
